---
zcwl review/fix handoff (all changes uncommitted)

Verification: zig fmt --check, zig build test (null + wayland),
test-unit 7/7, ReleaseSafe, example run, and fresh null build all pass.

Key decisions:
- startDragFiles without a data device -> Unsupported (matches public docs
  and the null backend; Uninitialized is reserved for clipboard get/set).
- setSize(0) is rejected; fullscreen uses setFullscreen().
- Window structs are retained until App.uninit so repeated destroy() is safe.
- Cursor images are application-global per state; IME enablement is per-window.

Known limits: wl_seat hotplug, tablet entry removal, eglTerminate,
window_minimized event (xdg has no such state), click_count, blocking
clipboard send, and cross-backend parallel builds needing serialization.

Generated/gitignored: src/backend_selected.zig and
src/linux/wayland/protocols/.